<para>This function reads the current value, applies the provided callable transformation, and writes the result back.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This operation is NOT atomic regarding interrupts or multi-threading. If the register is shared, external locking is required.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
